<s-1 id="RM0000020TS009X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000044Z00000">
<ptxt>Install Oil Pressure Sensor</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Apply CVT Fluid TC to the O-ring and install it to the oil pressure sensor. </ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C130655" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Install the oil pressure sensor.</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem>
<t-value1>21</t-value1>
<t-value2>214</t-value2>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Connect the oil pressure sensor connector.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000020TS009X_01_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___000034J00000">
<ptxt>Install Engine Under Cover Rear LH
</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Install the engine under cover rear LH with the 5 clips.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1></s-1>
